  "body": "### Description\n\nThe `Synapse-Trace-Id` response header added in https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/9480 needs to be [whitelisted](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/v1.75.0/synapse/http/server.py#L903) as well so web clients using CORS can read it.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\none a jaeger enabled synapse, make a request that is traced by jaeger.\n\n### Homeserver\n\nmatrix.org\n\n### Synapse Version\n\n1.76.0rc1\n\n### Installation Method\n\nI don't know\n\n### Database\n\ndon't know\n\n### Workers\n\nI don't know\n\n### Platform\n\ndon't know\n\n### Configuration\n\n_No response_\n\n### Relevant log output\n\n```shell\ndon't have any\n```\n\n\n### Anything else that would be useful to know?\n\n_No response_",
